  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/airshipFly.yarn-dontLandLuskiya-7099": "NIKOLAI: 那是卢斯基亚的领土。没必要惹这个麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/airshipFly.yarn-dontLandAuslen-7100": "NIKOLAI: 那是奥斯伦首都。就算他们肯放行，我也不想去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/airshipFly.yarn-dontLandWilds-7101": "JUNA: 等等。荒野里的地面坑坑洼洼，我们还是从南边走过去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-grandmasSpoon-7102": "BEN: 我还真以为把它弄丢了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7103": "ZIKARON: ……试炼……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7104": "NIKOLAI: 不行，完全看不懂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7105": "CORDELIA: 这种语言，我不曾学过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7106": "JUNA: 读人类的文字，实在不是我的强项。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7107": "BEN: 指望我读这个？找别人去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7108": "AGATA: 我接受守护者训练时，没有学过这种语言。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7109": "ALEXANDRA: 抱歉……我看不懂。其他人能认出来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-inspectWallZikaron-7110": "JEROME: 很遗憾，我解读不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-healansSeamlessRobe-7111": "NIKOLAI: 几乎要从手里滑过去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-healansSeamlessRobe-7112": "CORDELIA: 这难道真是那件……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-healansSeamlessRobe-7113": "JUNA: 这东西有点古怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-healansSeamlessRobe-7114": "BEN: 看来有人正光着身子在外头晃悠呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-healansSeamlessRobe-7115": "AGATA: 谁会把衣服丢在这种地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-healansSeamlessRobe-7116": "ALEXANDRA: 像是老太太穿的衣服……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-healansSeamlessRobe-7117": "JEROME: 这里面织入了法术。不止一道……几十道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-perotCh11-7118": "PEROT: 准备买了？这可是专门给你留的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-perotCh11-7119": "PEROT: 亚历！你来得正好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-perotCh11-7120": "PEROT: 我有样东西，专门给你留着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-luskiyanBorderL-7121": "LUSKIYAN SOLDIER: 没有党颁发的护照，不准入境。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-luskiyanBorderR-7122": "LUSKIYAN SOLDIER: 站住！这里是卢斯基亚的领土。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-airshipRest-7123": "休息一会儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-airshipRest-7124": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-airshipRest-7125": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_shrine-7126": "DUCK DOG: 嘎汪！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_Battle-7127": "DUCK DOG: 嘎汪！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7128": "DUCK DOG: 嘎汪！嘎汪！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7129": "NIKOLAI: 呃……它玩够了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7130": "NIKOLAI: 呃……它玩够了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7131": "JEROME: 看来它玩够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7132": "CORDELIA: 这场闹剧应该结束了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7133": "AGATA: 真奇怪，这就结束了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7134": "BEN: 嘿，这根香肠……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7135": "JUNA: 我可没资格说别的动物古怪，不过……再见啦，伙计。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7136": "ALEXANDRA: 我倒觉得它挺可爱的，唉，算啦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_postBattle-7137": "DUCK DOG: 嘎汪！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_getMissedSausage-7138": "DUCK DOG: 嘎汪！嘎汪！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_getMissedSausage-7139": "获得魔法香肠！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_hint-7140": "<align=\"center\">（它留下了一股气味，像是微风拂过草原。）</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_hint-7141": "<align=\"center\">（它留下了一股气味，像是……高山上的草甸？）</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_hint-7142": "<align=\"center\">（它留下了一股气味，像是……沼泽？）</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-duckDog_hint-7143": "<align=\"center\">（它留下了一股气味，像是……被烈日烤晒的荒地。）</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan-7144": "HERMIT: 嚯，嘿嘿！你们竟然找到我的藏身处了，嗯……这是命运找上门了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan-7145": "HERMIT: 许多古老的魔法正在苏醒，嘿嘿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan-7146": "HERMIT: 不光是那个魔像和你们的土系小法师，连更古老的东西也开始苏醒了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan-7147": "HERMIT: 魔法最初的模样……一切开始时的模样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan-7148": "HERMIT: 所以，我想试一试，嗯？在以前，魔法靠的是拿一样东西，去换另一样东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan-7149": "HERMIT: 你们要能带来一件翁法洛斯饰品，嘿嘿，我就能换来某样……更加禁忌的东西，哈，嘿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7150": "HERMIT: 怎么样……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7151": "你知道哪里能找到翁法洛斯吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7152": "HERMIT: 哈，嘿！有些古人，会用龙鳞雕刻翁法洛斯饰品。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7153": "HERMIT: 所以，要是你们能找到一片到处是龙的森林……嗯，嘿嘿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7154": "交换翁法洛斯",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7155": "HERMIT: 嗯！手里有东西拿来交换，古老的魔法才能生效……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7156": "HERMIT: 嚯嚯，你们真走运！这么多年过去，看看深渊还认不认它……嚯嚯！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7157": "HERMIT: 让我看看……嘿……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7158": "HERMIT: 嗯哼……来了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7159": "HERMIT: 深渊接受了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7160": "用翁法洛斯换得特里凯尔！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7161": "你认得这些蛮族珠饰吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7162": "HERMIT: 这些宝石……只有土系法师才能切割成这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7163": "HERMIT: 看起来是这附近的东西，没有雪神？嚯嚯，那就不可能来自太靠北的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7164": "我们还能……交换……别的东西吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7165": "HERMIT: 暂时还不行，不过等其他古老之物也出现，也许就可以了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7166": "HERMIT: 不过，也用不了多久啦，嚯嚯！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/sideQuests.yarn-hermitMan2-7167": "没什么"
}
